2 CONT  Nils Olsen  Family 2 : Adrian Rotgertssøn Falkener  MARRIAGE: ABT 1538, Trondheim  +Peter Adriansen Falkener  +Rickert Adriansøn Falkener  +Anna Adriansdatter Falkener  +Michael Adriansen Falkener 
2 CONT
