1 NOTE Borgermester i Bergen.
1 NOTE     * RESIDENCE: 1574, Tok borgerskap i Bergen
2 CONT     * OCCUPATION: Handelsborger i Bergen
2 CONT     * BIRTH: ABT 1540, Trondheim (noe usikker mor)
2 CONT     * BAPTISM: (Michel/Mickel/Mikkel)
2 CONT     * DEATH: ABT 1588, Bergen (1585/1601) 
