0 @I6000000003575251883@ INDI
1 NAME Petter Jacobsen /Falch/
2 GIVN Petter Jacobsen
2 _MARNM Falch
2 NICK Petter
2 NICK Peder
1 NAME Petter /Jacobssøn/ (Falch)
1 NAME Petter Jacobssøn /Falch/
2 GIVN Petter Jacobssøn
2 SURN Falch
2 NICK Petter
2 NICK Peder
1 NAME Petter /Jacobssøn/ (Falch)
