2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 1519 in Torsnes.Jondal.hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sex: M 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Nils Ragvaldsson Brandvik b. About 1420 in Stockholm.Sweden 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Herborg Bårdsdatter Tre-Liljer-Torsnes b. 1435 in Torsnes.Jondal.Hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Also Known As: Peter 
2 CONT
