2 CONT *The Espe and Prestegaard Familes of Norway by Breta Carol Espe Soldat, v. 1, p. 147-180, "The Icelandic Connection".  -- Caryl Stalick
2 CONT *Wikipedia Íslenska/Icelandic: [http://is.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gottsk%C3%A1lk_grimmi_Nikul%C3%A1sson Gottskálk grimmi Nikulásson]
