1 NAME Peter Broch Andersøn /Gyth/
2 GIVN Peter Broch Andersøn
2 SURN Gyth
2 _MARNM Gyth
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1719
2 PLAC Hellesvik
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stamnes
3 STAE Alstahaug
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 11 AUG 1719
