1 NAME Ludwig Johannesen /Irgens/
2 GIVN Ludwig Johannesen
2 SURN Irgens
2 _MARNM Irgens
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1650
2 ADDR
3 CITY Itzehoe
3 STAE Schleswig-Holstein
3 CTRY Germany
