1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anna Jonsdatter Benkestok is the daughter of Jon Trondson Benkestok. She is mentioned in her fathers probate records as living in 1599.
2 CONT
2 CONT But she has never been married to Peder Jacobson Falch. She also had a son, born in Fana outside Bergen, in 1599, and the fathers name was Ulrik Meyer.
2 CONT
2 CONT I 1599 har Jens Kristensen Dull skrive i dagboki si: 16/9 ble Anna Benkestok forløst på Fana prestegård med en ung sønn ved Ulrik Meyer.”
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: Wilhelkmine Brandt: Slægten Benkestok and Jens Christensen lesemesters dagbok (a contemporary diary written by a teacher in Bergen at the time of the son's birth.)
