1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cornelia IRGENS 
2 CONT
2 CONT ABT 1679 - 1761
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH: ABT 1679, Røros (1699 ?) (usikker mor) 
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: 1761, Valsøyfjord, MR 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Henning IRGENS 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Anna Cathrine Hansdatter WESLING 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : Kristen Kristensen ENGE 
2 CONT
