2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT                                                                                      _Henrich JÜRGENS _______
2 CONT
2 CONT                                      _Johannes IRGENS ______________________________|
2 CONT
2 CONT                                     |                                               |_Catharina FRÜCHTNICHT _
2 CONT
2 CONT  _Henning IRGENS ___________________|
2 CONT
2 CONT |                                   |                                                _Henning ARNISÆUS ______+
2 CONT
