1 NAME Anne Audensdotter /Aspa/
2 GIVN Anne Audensdotter
2 SURN Aspa
2 _MARNM Trygge
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1650
2 PLAC Frei. MR
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1726
