1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nevnt i farens skifte 1723. Morbroren Jacob Mogensen Fugelstad ble formynder.
2 CONT We see Malena as witness at 1724 baptism of her sister's son Ole.
2 CONT We do not see Malena as witness at 1727 or 1730 baptisms of her sister's datters.
2 CONT Malena, her husband and son appear to have left the area after her son was baptised in 1728.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1725 fadder paa dopt: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/16553/201
2 CONT ** Malena Jacobsd. Dalosen
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1727 fadder paa dopt af Thomas Nordfjorden' barn: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/16553/229
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1728 fadder paa dopt af broren Ole Jacobsen' barn Jacob: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/16553/235
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1728 agteviet: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/16553/240
2 CONT ** trolov: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/16553/239
2 CONT *** Ivar Erichsen Lille Alteren g.m. Malena Jacobsdtr
2 CONT *** fadder: Elias Jacobsen og Anders Nielsen Lille-Alteren
2 CONT ** NOTE: Though these 2 records do not note Malena Jacobsdtr as from Dalosen, we see a baptism of Ivar Erichsen's son Jacob in 1728 with witnesses including 2 of Malena Jacobsdtr Dalosen's siblings: Ole Jacobsen Dalosen and Birte 
2 CONC Lille-Alteren.  One does wonder then if Elias Jacobsen Lille-Alteren (also a witness) is another brother to them all---perhaps a half-brother. https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/16553/242
